# CODEOWNERS routes review requests and, when "Require review from Code Owners"
# is enabled in branch protection, requires a listed owner to approve changes to
# matching paths. This complements the PR Guard workflow with a hard,
# branch-protection-enforced gate on the registry's trust boundary.
#
# ACTION REQUIRED: replace the placeholder owner below with your real GitHub
# username or team (e.g. @your-handle or @CloAI/maintainers), then uncomment.
# An unresolvable owner here, combined with required code-owner review, can
# BLOCK all merges — so these rules ship commented out until you set the owner.

# Trust boundary — only maintainers should change these:
# /.github/        @CloAI/maintainers
# /scripts/        @CloAI/maintainers
# /schemas/        @CloAI/maintainers
# /package.json    @CloAI/maintainers
# /pnpm-lock.yaml  @CloAI/maintainers
# /tsconfig.json   @CloAI/maintainers
# /registry.json   @CloAI/maintainers
